# CSP for the HTML shell (Phase 3.5 fix pass). The sidebar hotlinks real
# Spotify album/artist art from i.scdn.co (SPEC.md's cover-art rules —
# hotlinked, never re-hosted) and the official Spotify logo is served from
# this same origin (public/brand/). Verified safe to actually enforce: no
# data:/blob: image URLs anywhere in the app (src/recolor.ts's bakeRecolor
# returns a live <canvas>, not a data URL, so img-src doesn't touch it), and
# i.scdn.co is the only external image host in use. Scoped to img-src only —
# every other directive stays unset so this can't regress scripts, styles,
# or fonts (Google Fonts, the Vite module bundle) that never had a CSP.
#
# This lives here, not in worker/index.ts, because wrangler.jsonc's `assets`
# config has no `run_worker_first`: a request for "/" is served by
# Cloudflare's static-asset layer *before* the Worker is ever invoked, so a
# header set in the Worker's fetch handler never reaches the one response it
# would target. `_headers` is honored by that same asset layer, so it's the
# only place this policy can actually take effect.
/
  Content-Security-Policy: img-src 'self' https://i.scdn.co

/index.html
  Content-Security-Policy: img-src 'self' https://i.scdn.co
